abstract: >-
  Maple procedures and worksheets, with a MATLAB driver, for the quasinormal modes of scalar, electromagnetic and
  vector-type gravitational perturbations of the noncommutative geometry-inspired wormhole and of the classical
  Schwarzschild wormhole, under two boundary conditions at the throat. The radial equation is compactified, its
  boundary conditions are built into a factorisation of the solution, and a Chebyshev collocation in multiprecision
  arithmetic gives a quadratic eigenvalue problem, solved with polyeig and the Advanpix toolbox.
